### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/v1
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Auth - Send OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "01712345678"
}

### 3. Auth - Verify OTP (Check terminal log for the OTP in dev mode)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "01712345678",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 4. Auth - Register User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "01712345678",
  "name": "রাকিব হাসান",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "otp_verified_token": "PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_STEP_3"
}

### 5. Auth - Login User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "01712345678",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 6. Search Medicines (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines?q=Napa&limit=10

### 7. Generic Alternatives Finder (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/1/alternatives

### 8. User Medicines - Add Medicine
POST {{baseUrl}}/user-medicines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicine_id": 1,
  "dosage": "১টি ট্যাবলেট",
  "frequency": "twice_daily",
  "times": ["08:00", "20:00"],
  "meal_instruction": "after_meal",
  "start_date": "2026-08-17",
  "total_quantity": 20,
  "refill_alert_days": 3,
  "notes": "জ্বর কমলে বন্ধ করবেন"
}

### 9. User Medicines - Get My List
GET {{baseUrl}}/user-medicines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Dose Logs - Today's Schedule
GET {{baseUrl}}/dose-logs?date=2026-08-17
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Health Logs - Record Blood Pressure
POST {{baseUrl}}/health-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "blood_pressure",
  "value_1": 120,
  "value_2": 80,
  "unit": "mmHg",
  "notes": "বিকেলে মাপ নেওয়া হয়েছে"
}

### 12. Health Logs - Generate PDF Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/health-logs/report/pdf?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Admin - Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@oshudhsathi.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 14. Admin - Dashboard Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
